Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Audit creation portability independently of worker
 pool enrollment

Why: profile-local worker_pools absence suppressed structural diagnostics on the shared board. Keep scheduling guards unchanged; audit with the actual caller config and expose classifier failures conservatively.

Proof: no-pool DB/CLI/tool regressions failed on missing portable_reason before patch; focused audit and placement suites pass after. Shared-board fixtures assert enrollment stays unset and profile config unchanged.
